{
  "openapi": "3.1.0",
  "info": {
    "title": "UniverAcademy API — ordinary scoring and optional statistical bonus",
    "version": "0.2.9-admin-assignment-policy-a-candidate.1",
    "description": "PROVISIONAL, NOT ACCEPTED. New user decision freezes Rasch for a later phase and restores statistical bonus instead of the optional Rasch action. Exactly two active scoring mechanisms: ordinary and optional group statistical bonus. Unanswered counts as incorrect by explicit new user reply. Teacher own-group/subject optional action, Owner existing authority; no Admin activation. Question default45/editable, positive fractional points, initial individual off, ordinary display2, protected Asia/Tashkent admission, current-self-submitted population and frozen one-shot/recovery attribution retained from latest mechanics. API wire and numerical/storage proposals require Backend review; no implementation, migration or deployment performed. Local decision delta: transfer blocked only by a started current active attempt; revoke unstarted recovery eligibility on successful transfer and retain history. User selected policy A: Admin assignment requires existing manage_content and current group/subject scope; manage_roster is independent for roster mutations. No inherited acceptance."
  },
